32:58.230 --> 32:58.630
Benar.

33:07.920 --> 33:08.710
Jingjing.

33:13.500 --> 33:14.560
Jingjing, ini aku.

33:19.910 --> 33:20.670
Jingjing.

33:31.670 --> 33:32.430
Fei.

33:32.840 --> 33:34.900
